PHASE 9 — Opportunity Gap Engine

This is potentially the most valuable part.

Compare:

BUYER DEMAND SIGNALS
          +
COMPETITOR POSITIONING
          ↓
     OPPORTUNITY GAPS

Example:

Opportunity

YouTube-focused Roblox characters

Buyer intent: High
Competition signal: Low
Specificity: High
Service fit: High

Then explain:

Why this opportunity was identified.

This explanation is important.

Don't just give users a number.

PHASE 10 — Service Positioning Engine

Now tell the freelancer:

How should you position your service?

Generate a positioning structure:

TARGET BUYER
        ↓
PROBLEM
        ↓
DESIRED RESULT
        ↓
SERVICE
        ↓
DIFFERENTIATOR

Example:

For Roblox creators who need a recognizable character for their content, offer custom character + dynamic-head customization rather than positioning the service as generic Roblox modeling.

This is where your product starts becoming a strategy tool, not merely an SEO tool.

