PHASE 14 — OpenAI Intelligence Layer

Only now would I add the OpenAI API.

This is where you use AI for things that are difficult to handle with normal rules.

For example:

Marketplace Data
       ↓
Your Analysis Engine
       ↓
OpenAI
       ↓
Semantic Interpretation
       ↓
Natural-language Explanation

AI can help with:

semantic grouping
root-need analysis
buyer-language interpretation
positioning suggestions
listing rewriting
explanations
opportunity summaries

Your API key stays on the server, never inside the extension.

