The order I recommend for Cursor

Don't paste all 16 phases into Cursor at once.

Start with:

Phase 1 → test → Phase 2 → test → Phase 3 → test...

And every phase should tell Cursor:

Do not redesign or rewrite existing functionality. Inspect the current project first. Implement only this phase. Keep all existing functionality working.

That will make the project much easier to control.

